nt": "Instructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self Assessment.", "type": "text"}]}], "stimuli_ids": [], "template_override": 1, "id": 11, "type": "DWS"}], "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}], "type": "lab_options"}], "type": "scholar", "stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "welcome", "id": 0, "contents": [{}]}, {"type": "audio", "template_override": 1, "title": "", "_data": [], "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"coverimg": "engenn8le05ob08re2img01.jpg", "audiosrc": "engenn8le05ob08re2aud01", "images": [{"time": "0", "image": "engenn8le05ob08re2img01.jpg", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"time": "100", "image": "engenn8le05ob08re2img01.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Jessica</span>: Thanks for meeting me.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Justin</span>: Not a problem.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Jessica</span>: My cousin said that you worked in Colombia as an English teacher a couple years ago. I'm going as part of a student exchange program.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Justin</span>: Is that through Boston College?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Jessica</span>: Yes. Completing a degree in business administration in Colombia should open up a lot of doors and hopefully ... improve my Spanish.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Justin</span>: Sounds like a great opportunity. Are you living with a host family?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Jessica</span>: That's the plan. However, I'm supposed to be excited but I'm quite nervous.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Justin</span>: Why?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Jessica</span>: I know very little about the country."}, {"time": "31500", "image": "engenn8le05ob08re2img03.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Justin</span>: Well, expect a warm welcome. You will soon be part of the family.<br/>\nColombians value their families and relationships with friends. You definitely won't feel like a stranger!<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Jessica</span>: That's good to know. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Justin</span>: Colombians like to share their rich history of ethnic diversity. From food and clothing to music and dance, customs have been shaped by the Spanish, Caribbean and African influences brought in by outside settlers. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Jessica</span>:  It will be nice to compare the differences in customs.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Justin</span>: Partaking in some of the festivals and carnivals throughout the year is important. I went to Carnaval de Feria de las Flores while I was there. The flower shows in Medellin were spectacular.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Jessica</span>: Cool."}, {"time": "68500", "image": "engenn8le05ob08re2img03.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Justin</span>: Colombians also like to go to parks, movies, discos, and friend's houses in their free time. Music and dancing are an integral part of the culture.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Jessica</span>: Sounds just like me. I tend to see myself as a bit of a socialite.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Justin</span>: One thing I found interesting was their interest in American television.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Jessica</span>: Really? I might not feel so homesick.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Justin</span>:  Yeah, they love their sitcoms. I should head off. I'm on a 15 minute break.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Jessica</span>: Yes, I'm supposed to be in class. Thanks for the info."}]}}], "id": 1}, {"type": "video", "template_override": 1, "title": "", "_data": [], "contents": [{"type": "video", "value": {"images": [{"time": "0", "image": "", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"time": "19800", "image": "", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"bullet\"> What can you include when writing about manners and customs?</span>"}, {"time": "42000", "image": "", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"bullet\"> What should you include in your paragraph?</span>"}], "video_src": "engenn8le05ob08re3vid01"}}], "id": 2}], "id": 0}], "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "The New Waiter", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Colombian Culture", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 8, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 5, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B1.3", "type": "level"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"content": " Accurately use information about people's backgrounds in a wider variety  of communicative situations.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": " Writes well-organized texts or articles about explaining the rules and regulations in his/her industry using appropriate grammar, vocabulary, spelling coherence and cohesion, and different levels of formality. ", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Writes well-organized texts or articles about explaining the rules and regulations in his/her industry using appropriate grammar, vocabulary, spelling coherence and cohesion, and different levels of formality. ", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": " Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Writes well-organized texts or articles about explaining the rules and regulations in his/her industry using appropriate grammar, vocabulary, spelling coherence and cohesion, and different levels of formality. ", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Writes well-organized texts or articles about explaining the rules and regulations in his/her industry using appropriate grammar, vocabulary, spelling coherence and cohesion, and different levels of formality. ", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Writes well-organized texts or articles about explaining the rules and regulations in his/her industry using appropriate grammar, vocabulary, spelling coherence and cohesion, and different levels of formality. ", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": " Writes well-organized texts or articles about explaining the rules and regulations in his/her industry using appropriate grammar, vocabulary, spelling coherence and cohesion, and different levels of formality. ", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": " Writes well-organized texts or articles about explaining the rules and regulations in his/her industry using appropriate grammar, vocabulary, spelling coherence and cohesion, and different levels of formality. ", "type": "secondary_8"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"content": "engenn8le05ob08re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Gerunds and Infinitives", "type": "heading"}, {"content": " Gerunds and infinitives can sometimes be called verb complements. They may act as subjects or objects in a sentence.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "A gerund is the -ing form of a verb that acts as a noun. The noun refers to an activity instead of a person or thing.You can use a gerund as the subject, the complement, or the object of a sentence.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Examples:<br/><br/> Subject of sentence:<br/> <span class=\"italic\"> <span class=\"strong\">Reading</span> helps your comprehension and vocabulary. </span><br/><br/> Complement of sentence:<br/> <span class=\"italic\">Justin's favorite pastime is <span class=\"strong\">reading</span>. <br/><br/> Object of sentence<br/> <span class=\"italic\">He enjoys <span class=\"strong\">reading</span>. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "An infinitive is a verb form that acts as a noun. It is formed with to + base form of the verb. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": " Example: <span class=\"italic\">to talk</span>,  <span class=\"italic\">to enjoy</span>, <span class=\"italic\">to play</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You can<span class=\"italic\">not</span> add We've <span class=\"strong\">s</span>, We've <span class=\"strong\">es</span>, We've <span class=\"strong\">ed</span>, or We've <span class=\"strong\">ing</span> to the end. It is not a verb.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Dancing</span> is a central part of Colombian culture, whether this be done at a family home or in a busy nightclub.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Many Colombian like <span class=\"strong\">to boast</span> about their food, weather and music.", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": " Should and Suppose To", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You can use supposed to and should to talk about an obligation.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "An obligation is something you should do or that other people expect you to do.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You use the verb \"to be\" in front of  <span class=\"italic\">supposed to</span>:<br/> verb \u201cto be\u201d + supposed to + verb<br/><br/> or<br/> You can use the modal  <span class=\"italic\">should</span> to also show obligation, duty and correctness.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I'm supposed to be in class. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "I should head off.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "I'm supposed to be excited but I'm quite nervous. ", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "exchange program", "type": "name"}, {"content": " a  study abroad program at one of their institution's partner institutions.", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example:  I'm going as part of a student exchange program.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le05ob08aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": " These are words you would hear in a conversation about travel and cultures.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "open up doors", "type": "name"}, {"content": " when opportunities become available to someone.", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The experience should open up a lot of doors.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le05ob08aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "integral", "type": "name"}, {"content": "very important and necessary", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Music and dancing are an integral part of the culture.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le05ob08aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "socialite", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a person who is often seen at parties and other social events ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I tend to see myself as a bit of a socialite.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le05ob08aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "homesick", "type": "name"}, {"content": "sad because you are away from your family and home", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I might not feel so homesick.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le05ob08aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "sitcom", "type": "name"}, {"content": " a show that is on television regularly that is about a group of characters", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: They love their sitcoms.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le05ob08aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to partake", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to join with others in doing something", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I would like to partake in the festival activities.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le05ob08aud07", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Go online.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Choose a country that you would like to learn more about.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Research the manners and customs of that country.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write 2 paragraphs about what you read. Include topic sentences, supporting sentences and concluding sentences.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Include at least 1 gerund and 1 infinitive in each paragraph.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Proofread your work.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Read your paragraphs aloud to a partner.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I choose a country to learn about.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I research the manners and customs of a country.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I write 2 paragraphs about manners and customs. ", "type": "text"}]}], "type": "sena"}